---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Contact"
	description="Get in touch with Arnold Gamboa — feedback, pastoral AI questions, YouPastor, or collaborations that fit."
	path="/contact/"
>
	<article class="page">
		<h1>Contact</h1>
		<p class="page__lede">
			I’m Arnold. I write about building software, using AI in real work, and the overlap
			between technology, ministry, and small teams.
		</p>

		<p>
			Right now most of my building energy is going into{' '}
			<a href="https://youpastor.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YouPastor</a>,
			an AI workspace for pastors that I’m preparing to launch soon. A few other projects are
			paused while I focus on that.
		</p>
		<p>
			If something I wrote was useful, I’d like to know. If you’re a pastor, builder, or
			operator thinking through similar questions, I’m happy to compare notes.
		</p>
		<p>A few things I’m especially open to hearing about:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Something in a post that was wrong, unclear, or worth expanding</li>
			<li>
				How pastors are actually using AI in sermon prep, church communication, or weekly
				ministry
			</li>
			<li>Questions or feedback about YouPastor</li>
			<li>A collaboration that genuinely fits this season</li>
		</ul>

		<div class="contact-block">
			<p>Email</p>
			<p>
				<a href="mailto:arnold@gamboa.ph">arnold@gamboa.ph</a>
			</p>
			<p style="margin-bottom: 0">
				I read everything. I reply when I have something useful to say.
			</p>
		</div>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>
